# BAWAAL Back controls (LOCKED)

All navigational **Back** affordances on stealth-black surfaces use `src/components/BackLink.js`.

## Visual contract

- Accent default: electric blue `#3B82F6`
- Theme overrides allowed (e.g. Clinic mint `#4ADE80`) via `accent` prop
- Bold/black weight (`fontWeight: '900'`), `←` arrow prefix, bordered chip touch target
- Must remain readable on `#000000` — never mute gray / faint text

## Required usage

- Passport inline preview — “Back to Passport”
- Athlete Passport, Clinic, Upload, Fan Registration, Terms, Medical Card
- Locker Room — “Passport” reverse link to the Passport tab

Do not reintroduce dim `#94a3b8` / `#A0A0A0` back labels on these surfaces.
